(text "PWR_FLAG: tells ERC the GND net is driven (Feather GND pin is passive)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a6345764-9f5a-4ebd-a75b-3980ca1de0f2"))
(text "BREADBOARD NOTES\n1. PN532: set the DIP switch to I2C before powering up. Feather has 5k pull-ups on SDA/SCL;\n   the PN532 board's own pull-ups in parallel are fine.\n2. Avoid GPIO7 (STEMMA QT / I2C power enable), GPIO21 + GPIO33 (NeoPixel).\n3. USB pin = 5V only while powered from USB-C. On battery it is unpowered: amp would need BAT.\n4. Audio stage: build ONE of the two sheets below. They share the I2S_* / AMP_SD nets,\n   so ERC and netlists show both connected at once. That is documentation, not a circuit.\n5. ESPHome: i2s_audio lrclk=GPIO10, bclk=GPIO9, dout=GPIO11; i2c sda=GPIO3, scl=GPIO4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "48a66d78-bb57-4a72-94d6-f799507de29e"))
